{"1044760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Garden Of Mooj", "steam_appid": 1044760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a mooj</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/d601c83252d246c2294bd334586896ee.poster.avif?t=1633530509\" width=300 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/d601c83252d246c2294bd334586896ee.webm?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/d601c83252d246c2294bd334586896ee.mp4?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Garden of Mooj is a cute 3D sandbox game with in depth life simulation. Guide your mooj as they breed and evolve over time, unlocking new structures for your garden.<br><br>Or, just relax and play with your mooj for a bit.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Each mooj is completely unique, with their own name, pattern, coloring, and more<br></li><li> Manage your mooj's diet carefully to control their evolution<br></li><li> Forage for food throughout the garden, with over 100 unique foods to discover<br></li><li> Defend from monsters at night<br></li><li> Compete in mooj races for hats<br></li><li> Discover forgotten secrets by raising specific types of mooj<br></li><li> Construct various buildings to increase your garden's revenue</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/fbb5d9861faf67ebe5a6dce64ed0b956.poster.avif?t=1633530509\" width=450 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/fbb5d9861faf67ebe5a6dce64ed0b956.webm?t=1633530509\" type=\"vid